 genuine reaction.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nLine up your shot and hit the shutter. A sound plays. A few seconds later — snap — the camera catches whatever face your subject just made. No posing. No warning. Just pure, honest reaction.\n\nTWO MODES\n• Tootographer Mode — full viewfinder and on-screen shutter. You're behind the camera, directing the chaos.\n• Smelfie Mode — the innocent-looking one. No visible controls, triggered by your volume button, so your subject never sees it coming.\n\nFEATURES\n• 14 built-in sounds across Classic and Bonus packs\n• \"Record your own\" mode - use wisely!\n• Silent-switch override — the sound plays loud even when your phone's on silent\n• Every photo is watermarked \"Shot by a Tootographer,\" so the joke travels with every share\n• Built-in gallery (My Flatulogue) with favorites, editing, cropping, and one-tap sharing\n• Filters and crop tools to polish your masterpiece before you send it\n• Front and rear camera support\n\nMADE FOR SHARING\nEvery reaction shot is begging to be sent to the group chat. Point & Toot photos carry their own watermark, so the fun — and the app — travel with every share.\nLaunch price: just 99¢. One-time purchase, no subscriptions.\n\nJoin the Toot Force: Download Point & Toot today and start shootin' and tootin'!", "sellerUrl": "https://pointandtoot.com", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "7588864", "formattedPrice": "￦1,100", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}